-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1169
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1211
 msgid "Per-step density multiplier applied to layer 2 only. Lower values keep the echo deck from competing visually with the cumulus deck below."
 msgstr ""
 
 #. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLayer2Color
-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1184
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1226
 msgid "Base color (albedo) of the layer-2 echo deck, independent of the main cloudColor. Defaults to the same near-white so the deck matches layer 1 until changed; tint it to differentiate the upper deck (e.g. cooler high cirrus). The deck shares all other look knobs with layer 1 (phase, multi-scatter, detail, etc.)."
 msgstr ""
 
 #. option rtx.atmosphere.cloudLayer2CellSizeKm
-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1191
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_atmosphere.h:1233
 msgid "Size of the layer-2 deck's cloudlets in km [0.1..6]. Altocumulus elements are a few hundred metres across, a degree or a few seen from below. The deck reads layer 1's cloud bodies at this size, and its coverage sets how much of the sky its patches fill."
